---
// Pit-board hero — PORT of the reference Caddie landing structure
// (Landing.tsx hero + .pb styles), content updated for the fresh product.
// The device composition is clearly-labelled illustrative markup: no real
// captures of the fresh build exist yet (plan amendment: hero art is
// illustrative until real fresh-workspace captures exist).
---

<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="pb-hero-h">
	<div class="hero-l">
		<p class="eyebrow"><span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lbl mono">an evidence-backed build assistant</span></p>
		<h1 id="pb-hero-h" class="h1">It carries the build.<br />You swing.</h1>
		<p class="lede">
			Builds rarely die from bad code. They die from fine print nobody read,
			scope that ate the weekend, and a delivery nobody can verify. Caddie
			works all three so the hours you have go into the build.
		</p>
		<div class="hero-cta">
			<a class="btn btn-key" href="/app/">Open the workspace</a>
			<a class="btn btn-line" href="#pb-card">See the card</a>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="hero-r">
		<div class="devices">
			<div class="shot">
				<div class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="host mono">illustrative · planned workspace</span></div>
				<div class="shot-body">
					<div class="frag">
						<p class="frag-k"><span style=`color: var(--pb-warn)`>clock · deadline</span><span class="pill" style=`background: var(--pb-tint-warn); color: var(--pb-warn)`>locked</span></p>
						<h4>Submit by Oct 26 · 5pm EDT — video is the artifact</h4>
						<p class="mrow" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;"><span class="k">Your time</span><span class="ar" style=`color: var(--pb-warn)`>→</span><span class="v">Sun 26 Oct, 10:00</span></p>
						<p class="mrow"><span class="k">Review</span><span class="ar" style=`color: var(--pb-warn)`>→</span><span class="v">Oct 22</span></p>
						<p class="fresh">· updated 3h ago</p>
					</div>
					<div class="frag">
						<p class="frag-k"><span style=`color: var(--pb-ok)`>verdict · fit</span><span class="pill" style=`background: var(--pb-tint-ok); color: var(--pb-ok)`>strong fit</span></p>
						<h4>Eligible, and it fits your week</h4>
						<p class="mrow" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;"><span class="k">Stack</span><span class="ar" style=`color: var(--pb-ok)`>→</span><span class="v">React + Hono</span></p>
						<p class="mrow"><span class="k">Evidence</span><span class="ar" style=`color: var(--pb-ok)`>→</span><span class="v">3 claims, all cited</span></p>
						<p class="fresh">· updated 6h ago</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="mobile-shot" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative phone composition: blocked-rules and quiet-watch cards in one column">
				<div class="shot-body">
					<div class="frag">
						<p class="frag-k"><span style=`color: var(--pb-danger)`>fault · rules</span><span class="pill" style=`background: var(--pb-tint-danger); color: var(--pb-danger)`>blocked</span></p>
						<h4>No deadline parsed yet</h4>
						<p class="mrow" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;"><span class="k">Meaning</span><span class="ar" style=`color: var(--pb-danger)`>→</span><span class="v">unknown, not "no deadline"</span></p>
					</div>
					<div class="frag">
						<p class="frag-k"><span>watch · rules</span><span class="pill">quiet</span></p>
						<h4>Nothing moved since yesterday</h4>
						<p class="mrow" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;"><span class="k">Last check</span><span class="ar">→</span><span class="v">18:40 · clean</span></p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<p class="devices-cap">
			Illustrative composition of the planned workspace — not a live capture.
			The fresh build proves itself in the open before the screenshots are real.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>
